      "nodeId": "triangle-midpoints/corner-triangles-quarter-area",
      "parentId": "triangle-midpoints/equal-area-program",
      "nodeType": "result",
      "title": "Areas of the three corner midpoint triangles",
      "summary": "The judgments establish [AEF]=[BFD]=[CDE]=[ABC]/4. Accepted justifications include the included-angle area formula, half-scale similarity, vertex-centered homothety, and a base-height calculation in which both the midpoint base and corresponding altitude scale by 1/2. Under nondegeneracy, the three areas are positive.",
